<BaseLayout title="Automation, AI, and software for modern companies" description="We examine how your team operates, find where time is lost, and design automation, AI agents, and software that improve productivity without adding operational complexity." locale="en" path="en">
<section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Automation, AI, and software for modern companies</span><h1>Your business does not need more tools.<span>It needs the right ones working together.</span></h1><p class="lede">We examine how your team operates, find where time is lost, and design automation, AI agents, and software that improve productivity without adding operational complexity.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/en/assessment/now">◉ Start my assessment now</a><a class="btn outline" href="/en/assessment/schedule">◷ Schedule my assessment</a></div><div class="notes"><span>Free initial assessment</span><span>Available in English and Spanish</span><span>Immediate preliminary summary</span></div><div class="system-flow"><div class="flow-chip">Automation</div><div class="flow-chip">AI agents</div><div class="flow-chip">Software</div><div class="flow-output">One connected system →</div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Technology is rarely the real problem</span><h2>Work slows down when processes, people, and tools operate separately.</h2><p>We do not recommend software because it is trending. We look for repeated work, missing information, and decisions that arrive too late.</p></div><div class="grid">{[["Manual work keeps multiplying","Data is copied between forms, spreadsheets, and systems that never stay in sync."],["Follow-up depends on memory","Requests, customers, and important tasks have no visible next step."],["Information is hard to turn into decisions","Reports arrive late or take hours of manual preparation."]].map(([t,p],i)=><article class="card"><div class="icon">0{i+1}</div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section alt"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Solutions</span><h2>Technology tied to a clear operational outcome.</h2><p>Start with one targeted improvement or build a system in phases. We choose the technology after understanding the process.</p></div><div class="grid">{[["Process automation","Connect recurring tasks, approvals, follow-up, and reporting so work keeps moving.","/en/solutions/automation"],["AI agents","Voice and text agents that collect information, handle requests, and perform tasks within defined boundaries.","/en/solutions/ai-agents"],["Software and integrations","Applications and integrations that connect the data and tools your company already uses.","/en/solutions/software-and-integrations"]].map(([t,p,h])=><a class="card" href={h}><div class="icon">↗</div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p><p style="margin-top:18px;color:#c2410c;font-weight:800">Explore solution →</p></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section dark"><div class="container assessment-panel"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Start with clarity</span><h2>An assessment that also demonstrates what we can build.</h2><p>Our voice agent runs a structured 12–15 minute discovery session. You receive three preliminary opportunities, expected impact, and a clear next step.</p><div class="actions" style="justify-content:flex-start"><a class="btn" href="/en/assessment/now">◉ Start my assessment now</a><a class="btn outline" href="/en/assessment/schedule">◷ Schedule my assessment</a></div></div><div class="voice-card"><strong>Voice-guided assessment · 12–15 min · ES / EN</strong><ul><li>Understands your current process</li><li>Finds repetitive work</li><li>Prioritizes opportunities</li><li>Delivers an immediate summary</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">How we work</span><h2>Understand first. Design second. Then implement.</h2></div><div class="steps">{[["01","Assess","Map processes, friction, tools, and priorities."],["02","Prioritize","Separate real opportunities from ideas that do not justify investment yet."],["03","Design","Define the workflow, controls, and technology required."],["04","Implement","Build, test, train, and measure with real usage."]].map(([n,t,p])=><div class="step"><strong>{n}</strong><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section alt"><div class="container founder"><img src="/team/julio-marte.jpeg" alt="Julio Alberto Marte Balbuena" loading="lazy"/><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Direct accountability</span><h2>A technology firm with founder-level attention.</h2><p>Julio leads assessments, solution design, and each client relationship. QuisqueyaTech works from the Dominican Republic with companies at home and abroad.</p><p><strong>Julio Alberto Marte Balbuena</strong><br/>Founder and automation & AI consultant</p><a class="btn outline" href="/en/about">Learn more</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Resources</span><h2>Resources for better technology decisions</h2><p>Practical guidance on automation, AI agents, and systems integration—without empty trends or inflated promises.</p><a class="btn outline" href="/en/recursos">View resources</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark signature-cta"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px;text-align:center"><h2>Find where technology can create the greatest impact.</h2><p>Complete the assessment now or reserve a time that works for you.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/en/assessment/now">Start my assessment now</a><a class="btn outline" href="/en/assessment/schedule">◷ Schedule my assessment</a></div></div></section>
